    <string name="ai_reranker_benefit_title">How smart matching works</string>
    <string name="ai_reranker_benefit_detail">Smart matching dramatically improves how well the AI understands your question and selects the right tool or information. Benefits include:\n\n• Better understanding of synonyms and paraphrased questions\n• More accurate tool selection (e.g., "I\'m cold" correctly matches temperature/weather tools)\n• Improved knowledge search in survival guides\n• Works completely offline — no download required\n• Built-in semantic algorithm (0 MB download)\n\nWhen disabled, the AI uses simple keyword matching which may miss semantically relevant tools.</string>
